 Roundtable&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Matt Cybulsky PhD&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Podcast&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.spotify.com/show/7vBnEoqpFssnYGS0kAQzRG&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;noScroll&quot;:false}\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/show/7vBnEoqpFssnYGS0kAQzRG\" frameborder=\"0\" gesture=\"media\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allow=\"encrypted-media\" data-component-name=\"Spotify2ToDOM\"></iframe><p>Listen away.  Talking FDA Breakthrough Pathway, measurement based care, and the future of heath.   Also Sauron and Parachutes make an appearance.</p><p>Also, because I love podcasts, I am a guest on a lot of them.  I was on another podcast today, the next installment of the Carlat Report!  </p><div class=\"apple-podcast-container\" data-component-name=\"ApplePodcastToDom\"><iframe class=\"apple-podcast \" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/id1463414537?i=1000654639325&quot;,&quot;isEpisode&quot;:true,&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/podcast-episode_1000654639325.jpg&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;(Wounded Healers) Guide to Self-Disclosure&quot;,&quot;podcastTitle&quot;:&quot;The Carlat Psychiatry Podcast&quot;,&quot;podcastByline&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:1306000,&quot;numEpisodes&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;targetUrl&quot;:&quot;https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wounded-healers-guide-to-self-disclosure/id1463414537?i=1000654639325&amp;uo=4&quot;,&quot;releaseDate&quot;:&quot;2024-05-06T06:00:00Z&quot;}\" src=\"https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/id1463414537?i=1000654639325\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay *; encrypted-media *;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p></p><p></p>","text":"The Frontier Psychiatrists is presenting at ATA Nexus here in Phoenix!\n\nand I knocked out this interview on day 1—yesterday!\n\nListen away. Talking FDA Breakthrough Pathway, measurement based care, and the future of heath. Also Sauron and Parachutes make an appearance.\n\nAlso, because I love podcasts, I am a guest on a lot of them. I was on another podcast today, the next installment of the Carlat Report!\n\nSubscribe now"}